    "rule": "user-policy",
    "policy_ref": "ADR-040 Decision, docs/decisions/ADR-040-package-one-dependency-closed-portable-router.md at 66f52785813a8453e7c7d54f2371aa8f6e465640: data the router never reads remains in the full checkout, and the installed adapter names the omitted data and refuses an operation that needs it. Applied three times between 2026-09-18 and 2026-09-20 by the checkpoint-authority, Lazarus and Tabularium omissions. Under that policy the full source checkout is already the second home of omitted payloads, so the survivor that needs no second repository and no human-pushed workflow is taken. Study section 4 records the reading; the user may overrule it before receipt."
